      "name": "Secondary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button",
      "description": "Native secondary button in its default, hover, and keyboard focus states.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button\">Import profile…</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button{background:#172c33;color:#f2f6f1;border:1px solid #9eafa9;border-radius:4px;min-height:28px;padding:4px 12px;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;}.ds-button:hover{background:#24483f;border-color:#bce9de}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:none;border:2px solid #71e2e6;padding:3px 11px}.ds-button:active{background:#0a3935}.ds-button:disabled{color:#9dafa9;background:#1b292c;border-color:#40534f}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Gold border by default, cyan on keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">Create ROM</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{background:#172c33;color:#f2f6f1;border:1px solid #9eafa9;border-radius:4px;min-height:28px;padding:4px 12px;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;background:#173e38;border:2px solid #efd574;font-weight:600;padding:3px 17px}.ds-primary:hover{background:#245d4f}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:#71e2e6}.ds-primary:active{background:#0a3935}.ds-primary:disabled{color:#9dafa9;border-color:#53615a;background:#1b292c}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Ink background and cyan focus border with a consistent field width.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\">Seed <input class=\"ds-input\" value=\"exemple-2026\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{color:#f2f6f1;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:#082b24;padding:12px}.ds-input{background:#0b1c20;color:#f2f6f1;border:1px solid #829e98;border-radius:4px;min-height:24px;padding:5px 8px;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:none;border:2px solid #71e2e6;padding:4px 7px}.ds-input:hover:not(:focus-visible){border-color:#bce9de}.ds-input:disabled{color:#9dafa9;border-color:#40534f}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Wizard steps",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "selection",
      "description": "Three adjoining steps. The active step uses the cursor, a distinct fill, and a contrasting border.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-steps\"><button>1. ROM</button><button aria-current=\"step\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><path d=\"M1 8a7 7 0 0 1 14 0Z\" fill=\"#d83a35\" stroke=\"#111\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/></svg>2. Settings</button><button>3. Create</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-steps{display:flex;gap:0}.ds-steps button{background:#172c33;color:#f2f6f1;border:1px solid #9eafa9;border-radius:4px;min-height:28px;padding:4px 12px;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;border-radius:0;flex:1;min-height:30px;white-space:nowrap}.ds-steps button[aria-current]{background:#125359;border:2px solid #71e2e6;padding:3px 11px}.ds-steps button:hover{background:#24483f}.ds-steps button:focus-visible{outline:none;border:2px solid #71e2e6;padding:3px 11px}.ds-steps button:active{background:#0a3935}.ds-steps svg{height:15px;width:15px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:6px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Checkbox",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "A dark check mark on cyan, with a separate text label.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /><span>Replace Espeon</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:#082b24;color:#f2f6f1;padding:6px;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;}.ds-check input{appearance:none;width:17px;height:17px;margin:0;border:1px solid #a3bdb1;border-radius:2px;background:#0b1c20;position:relative}.ds-check input:checked{background:#60d4d9;border:2px solid #d6faf1}.ds-check input:checked:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:3px;top:1px;width:5px;height:9px;border:solid #082b24;border-width:0 2px 2px 0;transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-check input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #71e2e6;outline-offset:2px}.ds-check:hover{color:#8be8e7}.ds-check input:disabled{background:#40564d;border-color:#50665b}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Menu panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "menu-panel",
      "description": "Two angular vector outlines frame a text panel.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 1H328L339 12V138L328 149H12L1 138V12Z\" fill=\"#082b24\" stroke=\"#b6ccc4\" stroke-width=\"2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><path d=\"M13 5H327L335 13V137L327 145H13L5 137V13Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#54726c\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg><div><h3>Choose your settings</h3><p>The controls use native widgets and localized labels.</p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{position:relative;width:340px;max-width:100%;min-height:150px;color:#f2f6f1;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;}.ds-panel>svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}.ds-panel>div{position:relative;padding:20px 24px}.ds-panel h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-panel p{font-size:13px;color:#c1d8cf;margin:0}"
    },
