      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "The checkbox enables the next numeric field. Disabled values stay visible with reduced emphasis.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-dependent\"><label class=\"ds-dependent-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /><span>Customize shinies</span></label><label class=\"ds-dependent-rate\">Shiny chance (%)<input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"5.0000\" aria-label=\"Shiny chance (%)\" /></label><p>At 0% none are Shiny. At 100% all are Shiny. Existing Pokémon keep their status.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-dependent{background:#082b24;color:#f2f6f1;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:grid;gap:12px;padding:16px}.ds-dependent-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:6px 0}.ds-dependent-toggle>input{appearance:none;width:17px;height:17px;margin:0;border:1px solid #a3bdb1;border-radius:2px;background:#0b1c20;position:relative}.ds-dependent-toggle>input:checked{background:#60d4d9;border:2px solid #d6faf1}.ds-dependent-toggle>input:checked:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:3px;top:1px;width:5px;height:9px;border:solid #082b24;border-width:0 2px 2px 0;transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-dependent-toggle>input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #71e2e6;outline-offset:2px}.ds-dependent-toggle:hover{color:#8be8e7}.ds-dependent-rate{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-dependent-rate>input{flex:1;min-width:100px;background:#0b1c20;color:#f2f6f1;border:1px solid #829e98;border-radius:4px;padding:5px 8px;min-height:24px;font:inherit}.ds-dependent-rate>input:focus-visible{outline:none;border:2px solid #71e2e6;padding:4px 7px}.ds-dependent-rate>input:disabled{color:#9dafa9;border-color:#40534f}.ds-dependent>p{margin:0;color:#c1d8cf;font-size:13px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "selection",
      "description": "The selected view uses a teal fill and cyan border.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\" aria-label=\"Settings views\"><button aria-selected=\"true\">Configuration</button><button>Pokémon preview</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:0}.ds-tabs button{flex:1;background:#172c33;color:#f2f6f1;border:1px solid #69877a;border-radius:0;padding:6px 13px;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-tabs button[aria-selected=true]{background:#125359;border-bottom:2px solid #71e2e6}.ds-tabs button:hover{background:#24483f}.ds-tabs button:focus-visible{outline:1px solid #71e2e6;outline-offset:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "XD menu panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "menu-panel-xd",
      "description": "The same cut-corner template in the observed XD palette.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 1H328L339 12V138L328 149H12L1 138V12Z\" fill=\"#24191a\" stroke=\"#c5b6a9\" stroke-width=\"2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><path d=\"M13 5H327L335 13V137L327 145H13L5 137V13Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6c4945\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg><div><h3>Choose your settings</h3><p>The controls use native widgets and localized labels.</p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{position:relative;width:340px;max-width:100%;min-height:150px;color:#fff4e6;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;}.ds-panel>svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}.ds-panel>div{position:relative;padding:20px 24px}.ds-panel h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-panel p{font-size:13px;color:#e2c9bb;margin:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Home audio control",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-home",
      "description": "Neutral home-header colors; independent checked preference.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-home-audio\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Music</button>",
      "css": ".ds-home-audio{background:#202327;color:#e5e7eb;border:1px solid #727782;border-radius:4px;min-height:28px;padding:4px 12px;font:14px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-home-audio[aria-pressed=true]{background:#30343a;color:#f2f3f5;border:2px solid #cbd0d8;padding:3px 11px}.ds-home-audio:hover{background:#30343a;border-color:#cbd0d8}.ds-home-audio:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #cbd0d8;outline-offset:2px}.ds-home-audio:active{background:#17191c}.ds-home-audio:disabled{background:#202327;color:#969ba5;border-color:#626772}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The menus of Colosseum",
    "overview": "The desktop interface keeps the original menu character: angular frames, dark\npanels, small Pokémon portraits and a visible selection cursor. Native Qt fields,\nbuttons and lists handle the work. The Colosseum palette is the baseline; XD uses\nthe same composition with charcoal, red and gold. The game-selection screen uses\na neutral black-to-gray background and neutral header controls.\n\nThe bundled interface pack supplies logos, background artwork, music and menu\nsounds before a ROM is selected. Content stays readable without an available\naudio device. System fonts and accessible Qt controls remain the desktop convention.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One shared three-step wizard and Pokémon-sheet template for both games.",
      "Colosseum green/indigo and XD charcoal/red themes, with neutral home controls.",
      "Cut-corner frames and tonal surfaces without decorative shadows.",
      "Small authentic portraits beside localized, accessible text.",
      "Persistent navigation, visible scrolling and explicit loading states.",
      "Shared wording and behavior across all six interface languages."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Theme Rule",
        "body": "A theme changes the palette and artwork, not the shared controls, wording or workflow. Native game differences keep their own accurate help. ",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Native Text Rule",
        "body": "Useful text remains localized Qt content. Artwork does not replace labels, help, search, progress or keyboard focus. ",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Frame Rule",
        "body": "The double frame belongs to the work panel. Controls use finer borders so the panel, content and current action remain distinct. ",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Shared Template Rule",
        "body": "Common controls have the same order, words and behavior in both games. Do not create a separate XD synonym or omit a shared feature to fit its theme.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** reuse shared Qt templates, copy and option metadata for both games.",
      "**Do** retain each game's logo, palette and bundled interface media.",
      "**Do** keep localized text, keyboard focus and accessible control names.",
      "**Do** keep navigation visible and scrolling confined to the active content.",
      "**Do** distinguish pending, loading, cancelled, failed and current previews."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** change shared wording or behavior merely because the theme changes.",
      "**Don't** present a cosmetic loading sample as a final seeded result.",
      "**Don't** show a known species or shiny status when the preview cannot establish it.",
      "**Don't** make the visual/audio startup depend on selecting a ROM or downloading a cache.",
      "**Don't** replace native controls with rasterized text or distribute proprietary fonts."
    ]
  }
}
